# AI / Claude usage (§9.4, §10.4, §19.12.9)

Every Claude-backed feature MUST go through the registered prompt pipeline. No inline prompt strings in feature code.

## The only entrypoint

```ts
// ❌ BAD — inline prompt, no audit, no redaction, no budget check
const response = await anthropic.messages.create({
  model: 'claude-3-7-sonnet-20250219',
  messages: [{ role: 'user', content: `Summarise these goals: ${client.goals.next12Months}` }],
});

// ✅ GOOD — registered prompt key, automatic redaction + audit + budget enforcement
import { callClaude } from '@advicelink/ai';

const result = await callClaude('soaWizard.goals.assist', { client }, ctx);
```

## Registry shape (§10.4)

Prompts are registered in `packages/ai/src/registry.ts` keyed by `promptKey` (e.g. `factFindGoals`, `soaWizard.cover.assist`, `soaWizard.strategyRecommendations.assist`, `arWizardReasons`, `fileNoteGenerator`). Each entry has: `systemPrompt`, `userTemplate`, `inputSchema`, `outputSchema`, `redaction`, `model`, `temperature`, `maxTokens`, `costCapCentsPerCall`, `enabled`.

Tenant-level overrides are managed via the AI Prompts admin page; do not branch on `tenant_id` inside the prompt registry — the override pipeline handles it.

## `callClaude` does the following automatically

1. Looks up the prompt template (never inline a prompt string).
2. Redacts PII per the prompt's `redaction.fields` list (mode `mask` or `omit`). PII fields list lives in §19.16.
3. Records the invocation in `ai_invocations` (tokens, cost, latency, redacted in/out).
4. Enforces tenant `aiBudgetUsdPerMonth` (default 200 USD); over-budget → fails closed with a "Contact your tenant admin" error.

## Sensitive fields that MUST be redacted before any Claude call

`personal.taxFileNumber`, `personal.partnerTaxFileNumber`, `personal.healthNotes`, `insuranceClaim.notes`, all insurance underwriting notes. See §19.16.

## Env vars

Use `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` (preferred). The legacy `CLAUDE_API_KEY` is accepted by `apps/api/src/config/env.ts` for a 30-day transition with a deprecation warning. Default model: `claude-3-7-sonnet-20250219` (override in registry per prompt).
